# a project saved before cane was retired (2026-11; tests/fixtures/make_v20_cane.xy) loads: each cane track the nearest
# sound of another engine by its model (T3's bowed string knit's ribbon, T7's bell rayon's tubular bell), its notes, mix,
# volume and sends as they were; a cane user preset (U3, a koto: a pluck) knit's pluck; the project plays and saves
storeload tests/fixtures/store_v20_cane.bin
reboot
wait 400
expect tempo 103
expect par3.engine 0
expect par7.engine 1
expect par7.send2 50
expect par7.volume 90
expect note 7 1 1 60
expect note 7 1 5 67
expect note 7 1 9 72
tap PLAY
bars 0.3
expect playing 1
expect voices >0
bars 1
tap PLAY
preset 5 U3
expect par5.engine 0
projsave 1
reboot
wait 400
expect par3.engine 0
expect par7.engine 1
expect note 7 1 5 67
